## Why this file is `.md.excluded`

Per `model-report-TEMPLATE.md` (SELF-EXCLUSION rule): when a folder's model yields **zero verified public benchmark numbers** (every row below would read "no verified public score found" and all normalized dimensions would be guesses), do NOT save a scored `.md` — save this `.md.excluded` instead so `pnpm sync` skips it (it renames/skips `*.excluded` loudly) and it never poisons the average. Fabricating placeholder scores or borrowing an unverified sibling's numbers is forbidden.

## Model card (specs only — from repo curated `meta.json`)

- Name: Hy4 (Tencent). August 2026 open-weights flagship.
- Provider / access: Tencent (`tencent/hy4`); OpenCode Zen id per repo meta. Apache 2.0 open weights (self-hosted). noFreeId (no Zen Free ID) per `meta.json`.
- Architecture (repo `meta.json`): **770B total / 49B active MoE**, Apache 2.0 license.
- Context window: **1,000,000 tokens (960K in / 64K out)** (repo `meta.json`).
- Modalities (repo `meta.json`): "Text in/out" — text-only input/output.
- Pricing (repo `meta.json`): Apache 2.0 open weights, self-hosted (no paid tier listed).

